This demo illustrates how to integrate SurveyJS Form Library, Survey Creator, PDF Generator and Dashboard into a Remix application.

SurveyJS Form Library is available under the MIT license.

Survey Creator, PDF Generator and Dashboard are proprietary software. You can integrate these components and evaluate their functionality without a license. Production use requires a commercial license covering the components you use for each developer who works with the SurveyJS APIs or implements the integration.

For full licensing details, please refer to the SurveyJS Licensing FAQ and End-User License Agreement (EULA):

- https://surveyjs.io/faq#licensing
- https://surveyjs.io/Developer-License-Agreement.pdf
